, " CPU pipeline"], [6.061849, "content", " works similarly"], [6.08341, "content", ". An"], [6.105187, "content", " instruction passes"], [6.126502, "content", " through several stages:\n\n1. **"], [6.148273, "content", "Fetch** —"], [6.16996, "content", " get the next"], [6.191485, "content", " instruction.\n2. **Decode**"], [6.213198, "content", " — figure out what it means.\n"], [6.234669, "content", "3. **Execute** — do the"], [6.256222, "content", " math or"], [6.277584, "content", " operation.\n4. **Write back"], [6.299114, "content", "** — store"], [6.320775, "content", " the result.\n\nJust"], [6.342008, "content", " like the"], [6.363592, "content", " car wash, the CPU"], [6.38531, "content", " does not have only"], [6.407016, "content", " one car"], [6.42815, "content", " at a"], [6.449782, "content", " time. It has"], [6.471124, "content", " many instructions at different stages.\n\nSo"], [6.492706, "content", " while"], [6.51424, "content", " one instruction is being"], [6.535625, "content", " decoded"], [6.557403, "content", ", another is being fetched"], [6.578876, "content", ", and another is being finished"], [6.600667, "content", ".\n\nThis"], [6.62165, "content", " lets"], [6.643055, "content", " the CPU complete"], [6.664559, "content", " lots"], [6.686416, "content", " of instructions every"], [6.707888, "content", " second"], [6.729542, "content", ".\n\n---"], [6.750849, "content", "\n\n## 2. Branch prediction"], [6.772279, "content", ": guessing what you"], [6.7939, "content", " will"], [6.815434, "content", " do next\n\nProgram"], [6.836776, "content", "s often have decisions"], [6.858529, "content", ":"], [6.880363, "content", "\n\n```text"], [6.901808, "content", "\nif (score > 1"], [6.923357, "content", "00)\n    print"], [6.945202, "content", "(\"You"], [6.966453, "content", " win\")\nelse\n    print(\""], [6.988328, "content", "Try"], [7.010216, "content", " again\")\n```\n\nThis"], [7.031394, "content", " is called a **branch**,"], [7.05338, "content", " because the program"], [7.075085, "content", " can go"], [7.096697, "content", " left"], [7.118382, "content", " or right.\n\nThe CPU has"], [7.139914, "content", " to know"], [7.161198, "content", " which instructions"], [7.182839, "content", " to fetch"], [7.204031, "content", " next. But sometimes"], [7.223226, "content", " it"], [7.242025, "content", " cannot know until"], [7.261103, "content", " the branch is actually"], [7.280236, "content", " checked"], [7.299185, "content", ".\n\nSo"], [7.318322, "content", " it"], [7.337082, "content", " **"], [7.356109, "content", "predict"], [7.374893, "content", "s**.\n\nImagine you"], [7.393877, "content", " walk"], [7.412839, "content", " past"], [7.431883, "content", " a fork"], [7.450883, "content", " in"], [7.469886, "content", " the road every morning. One"], [7.489005, "content", " day you take the left"], [7.50797, "content", " path, then"], [7.526847, "content", " left"], [7.543656, "content", " again"]], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 86, "total_tokens": 1110, "completion_tokens": 1024, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "reasoning_tokens": 635}, "finish": "length", "ttft_s": 0.117749, "t_last_s": 7.543656, "t_end_s": 7.544022599991877, "completion_tokens": 1024, "decode_tok_s": 137.7609496052132, "captured": "2026-11-01 08:08:27"}